3. Data snapshots
================================================================================

The raw data snapshots under `data/raw/` are third-party material
re-distributed under fair use / open-data terms of the original sources:

  - Bitstamp BTCUSD OHLCV        — Bitstamp API Terms of Service
  - CryptoDataDownload ETHUSD/XRPUSD/SOLUSD  — CryptoDataDownload Open Data License
  - Yahoo Finance SPX/NDX/DXY/TLT — Yahoo Finance Terms of Service

Derived tables under `data/processed/` are original work of this framework
and are released under CC-BY-4.0 in line with the white-paper content.

